WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.400
The prerequisite OD-Arc juggle ends near the wall.

2
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.000
Standing medium kick intentionally whiffs.

3
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.350
The retreat makes Ryu’s normal throw miss.

4
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.350
Standing heavy punch punishes the throw whiff.

5
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.400
Sprint stop links standing heavy kick.

6
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.850
The medium target extends through another OD Arc Step.

7
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:06.900
Sprint launcher continues the juggle.

8
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:07.750
Light Edge finishes the new punish.
